+/-- `UniformSpacesTheory.convergent_cauchy` é falso: `Cauchy F` exige `F.NeBot`, e o filtro ⊥ satisfaz `⊥ ≤ 𝓝 x`
+    sem ser Cauchy (em α = Unit, x = ()). -/
+theorem convergent_cauchy_falso :
+    ¬ ∀ {α : Type} [UniformSpace α] (F : Filter α) (x : α), F ≤ nhds x → Cauchy F := by
+  intro h
+  exact (h (α := Unit) ⊥ () bot_le).1.ne rfl
